          {
            "id": "54799bf8-935d-49db-ad4f-f6e886464ffe",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "62d99fc6-d2b0-41ca-ad5b-7a0c97752c8a",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "45729d71-5fe0-416e-a4d7-d3d178498f76",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "Nib: The lodge\nboasts heated\nfloors, a private\nhorizon, and\nmature silence.",
                      "The silence is\nactually a broken\npump. I wrote the\nlisting before I\nsaw the pipe map.",
                      "I would like to\ncorrect that\nbefore someone\nbelieves me."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "b9390df5-7966-40e7-aaf0-2508df787bde",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "782a48ab-63e2-4b91-a399-05151fdffbaf",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "25243a0d-46de-480f-a7a0-093614a76fd6",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "55ade572-47fa-40c6-afcb-ec2b04c27c84",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "51b00948-8bf3-4991-ae7e-a4155529ac90",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "Nib lays two pages\nside by side. The\ninvoice names one\nvalve inspection\nand six repaired",
                      "roof panels. The\nsale schedule\nnames the lodge\nwalls and\ncourtyard but",
                      "excludes municipal\npipes. A tempting\nsummary says Slush\npaid for\neverything below",
                      "the roof. Nib\ncrosses it out.\nThe inspection\nbill names a\nservice, not a",
                      "transfer of the\ninspected object.\nHe asks for",
                      "wording a nervous\nbuyer could safely\nrepeat."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "62dba545-9b05-457c-a4ad-62e2059ad45a",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "74a6290d-59f2-40da-acb4-aad89bb688b0",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 2
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "92544d54-71af-4c97-a38f-513dc3bbc2ac",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "52cd0749-1bd6-48df-aa5e-570d7d9d5d57",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "529ceb8c-a2a5-46cc-aceb-14e09af16015",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "The disclosure\nlists walls, roof,\nand courtyard. It\nexcludes municipal\npipes and rights",
                      "of passage. A\nseparate\ninspection invoice\ncarries Slush's\nletterhead. Nib",
                      "circles EXCLUDES\nwith a pen\nexpensive enough\nto regret every\ncircle."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "c97c27aa-671f-4815-a831-c9e1c9f748bd",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
